    <solution><p>SOLUTION</p>
<p><me>\begin{array}{rcl} \displaystyle \int_0^{1} (4 e^x+3 \sin x)\, dx \amp =\amp   
\displaystyle  4 e^x-3 \cos x  \Big]_0^{1}
\\ \amp =\amp  (4 e^{1} - 3 \cos 1) - (4 e^0 - 3 \cos0 ) 
\\ \amp =\amp  4 e^{1} - 3 \cos 1 - 1 
\end{array}</me></p>
</solution>
